      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd 47 comprehensive Sony (VID 0x054c) camera entries sourced from libgphoto2 `camlibs/ptp2/library.c` research.\n\n### Classic DSC compacts (26 entries)\nDSC-F828, DSC-R1, DSC-T9, DSC-H1, DSC-T10, DSC-T100, DSC-W100, DSC-H2, DSC-H5, DSC-H3, DSC-H7, DSC-H9, DSC-T2, DSC-T200, DSC-W170, DSC-H10, DSC-W120, DSC-W150, DSC-W300, DSC-T77, DSC-T90, DSC-T900, DSC-H20, DSC-H50, DSC-T300, DSC-T700\n\n### DSLR-A / SLT / NEX series (9 entries)\nDSLR-A230, A330, A380, A850, A550, A500, A450, SLT-A33, NEX-3\n\n### Modern Alpha / ZV / Cinema PC Remote PIDs (12 entries)\n- **Alpha**: ILCE-7RM5 (A7R V) ×2, ILCE-7CM2 (A7C II) ×2, ILCE-7CR (A7CR), ILCE-6700 (A6700), ILCE-9M3 (A9 III)\n- **ZV**: ZV-E1 alt PID, ZV-1 II (ZV-1M2), ZV-1F\n- **Cinema**: FX30 PC Remote, FX6\n\n### Verification\n- All entries: `category=camera`, `hooks=[]`, `status=proposed`, `confidence=medium`\n- PTP interface: class 0x06, subclass 0x01, protocol 0x01\n- **Zero duplicate VID:PID pairs** — verified programmatically\n- Both `Specs/quirks.json` and `SwiftMTPKit/Sources/SwiftMTPQuirks/Resources/quirks.json` updated and identical",
